# Public component contract

Applies to `@rosettadash/web-components`, `react`, `angular`, `vue`, and `svelte`. Every public export is a **taxonomy atom or recipe** with identical import shape after the runtime segment.

## Import path (locked)

```text
@rosettadash/<runtime>/<group>/…/<component>
```

- `<runtime>` — `web-components`, `react`, `angular`, `vue`, or `svelte`
- `<group>/…` — one or more kebab segments from the taxonomy subpath (see `manifest.mjs`)
- `<component>` — kebab-case file segment; **same subpath on every runtime**
- **No** `@rosettadash/vendor/…` segment

```ts
import { VideoSource } from '@rosettadash/react/visual/media/video-source';
import { VideoSource } from '@rosettadash/web-components/visual/media/video-source';
```

Taxonomy **type keys** (dotted, e.g. `visual.media.video-source`) are permanent once shipped — never rename.

## Export surface

Every subpath export must provide:

| Export | Rule |
|--------|------|
| Component | PascalCase symbol matching `exportName` in manifest |
| Props type | `{ExportName}Props` — no public `any` |
| Event detail types | Named interfaces for non-trivial payloads |
| Defaults | Documented in JSDoc or prop default values |
| Types entry | Shipped `.d.ts` on the subpath |

Recipes (e.g. `AccordionLinkList`) compose atoms — they do not introduce new taxonomy `type` keys unless added to core registry **and** manifest.

## File and symbol naming

| Layer | Convention | Example |
|-------|------------|---------|
| Directory | Manifest `subpath` | `visual/media/video-source/` |
| WC file | `rd-{kebab}.ts` | `rd-video-source.ts` |
| WC class | `Rd{ExportName}Element` | `RdVideoSourceElement` |
| WC register | `registerRd{ExportName}` | `registerRdVideoSource` |
| Tag constant | `RD_*_TAG` or `DB_*_TAG` for legacy media | `DB_VIDEO_SOURCE_TAG` |
| React file | `{ExportName}.tsx` | `VideoSource.tsx` |
| Angular file | kebab from export | `video-source.ts` |
| Vue file | kebab `index.ts` | `video-source/index.ts` |
| Svelte file | `{ExportName}.svelte` + co-located `types.ts` | `VideoSource.svelte` |

## Custom elements

- Tag: `rd-` + kebab, aligned with BEM root block where practical (`rd-video-source`, `rd-chart-bar`).
- Registration must be **idempotent** — safe to call `registerRd*()` more than once.
- Framework components hosting a CE use the **same tag** as selector/host element (`selector: 'rd-video-source'` in Angular).

## DOM and CSS contract

Root element of every component:

1. **BEM block class** — `rd-{kebab}` derived from taxonomy via `taxonomyTypeToBemBlock()` (strip top-level category prefix, dots → hyphens, prefix `rd-`).
2. **`data-testid`** — equals the root block class (e.g. `data-testid="rd-chart-bar"`).
3. **No generic wrappers** — never `rd-atom` or untyped container-only roots.
4. **Elements/modifiers** — `rd-{block}__{element}`, `rd-{block}--{modifier}`.

Example block mapping:

| Taxonomy type | BEM root | CE tag |
|---------------|----------|--------|
| `visual.chart.bar` | `rd-chart-bar` | `rd-chart-bar` |
| `visual.input.text` | `rd-text-input` | `rd-text-input` |
| `visual.media.video-source` | `rd-video-source` | `rd-video-source` |

Builder app uses **`app-*`** BEM — never in runtime packages (`docs/28-app-component-css-convention.md`).

## Props and attributes

| Rule | Detail |
|------|--------|
| Scalar props | camelCase in TS; kebab-case HTML attributes on CEs |
| Boolean props | Reflect as presence attributes where CE-backed |
| Object/array props | **Never** JSON-stringify on attributes — use `setProperty(name, value)` on the CE host |
| `className` / `class` | Merged onto root; must not replace BEM block |
| `style` | Inline on root only; prefer `--rd-*` tokens for theme |
| Children | Default slot / `children` / `<ng-content>` / `{@render children?.()}` at documented position |

### Controlled open state (accordion, collapsible, modal)

| Runtime | Pattern |
|---------|---------|
| React | `open` + `onOpenChange` |
| Vue | `open` + `v-model:open` |
| Angular | `open` + `openChange` or two-way `[(open)]` |
| Svelte | `open` + `bind:open` |
| WC | `open` attribute + `open-change` event |

## Events

- CE event names: **kebab-case** (`video-file`, `crop-region`, `open-change`).
- `CustomEvent` with typed `detail`; set `bubbles: true` when parents must listen.
- Framework mapping:

| CE event | React | Vue emit | Angular output |
|----------|-------|----------|----------------|
| `video-file` | `onVideoFile` | `videoFile` | `videoFile` |
| `open-change` | `onOpenChange` | `openChange` | `openChange` |

Document every public event in the component's README row and Storybook catalog entry.

## Refs and host access

- React: `forwardRef` to root `HTMLElement` (or CE host element).
- Vue/Svelte/Angular: expose root element for CE-host wrappers.
- Callers tune internals via `--rd-*` on host/wrapper, not by reaching into shadow DOM (except documented CE properties).

## Component boundaries (must not)

- Fetch data or read env secrets inside a component — data arrives via props/inputs.
- Require a global context provider to render (except documented infra atoms).
- Import from `@rosettadash/*` sibling runtime packages (WC may import `@rosettadash/core` only).
- Import framework code into `web-components`.

## Light DOM vs shadow DOM

- **Default:** light DOM (`RosettaAtomElement` pattern) so host CSS and `rd-*` classes apply.
- **Allowed shadow DOM:** manual media CEs (`video-source`, `equirect-viewport`, `wasm/media`) — frameworks still expose the same props/events via CE-host.

## Typing checklist (before merge)

- [ ] Subpath exists on all five runtimes (or explicit grandfather exception)
- [ ] `{Name}Props` exported; no public `any`
- [ ] Root `rd-*` class + matching `data-testid`
- [ ] Complex props use `setProperty`, not attribute serialization
- [ ] Events typed and mapped in every CE-host wrapper
- [ ] README export table row updated

